# Canonical line endings across the repository.
#
# Object model E33 pins LF as a serialization rule for every Fibula object.
# With core.autocrlf active, Git would rewrite checked-in files to CRLF on
# checkout - which silently breaks byte-exact fixtures and makes the
# cross-platform determinism tests (E8, F-S1-06) fail on Windows only.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Golden vectors and test fixtures are byte-exact by definition: Git must not
# inspect or convert them at all. A "fixed" fixture is a broken format.
testdata/** -text
*.golden -text

# Binary test assets used for chunker and round-trip tests.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.exr binary
*.fbx binary
*.blend binary
*.wav binary
